---
import '../styles/jackfrost.css';
import SMT5JackFrost from '../assets/jackFrost/JackFrostSMT5Model.png';
import MT2JackFrost from '../assets/jackFrost/JackFrostMT2.png';
import RaihoGif from '../assets/jackFrost/RaihoSpin.gif';
import JFTrue from '../assets/jackFrost/JFTrue.gif';
import NahoUlt from '../assets/jackFrost/nahobeehoUlt.gif';
import Heehoing from '../assets/jackFrost/DemoneeHoSilly.png';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import  FrostDetails from '../components/frostDetails.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Hee-Ho!</title>
	</head>
	<body>
	<header>
	    <h1>𝕵𝖆𝖈𝖐 𝕱𝖗𝖔𝖘𝖙 </h1>
	</header>
	<div class='container'>
	    <Image src = {SMT5JackFrost} alt = 'Jack Frosts SMT5 model' width=250 height=250 class = "smt5jf"/>
		<div class ='quote'>
            <blockquote>"This time of Year being Cold and Frosty generally speaking, or when Jack-Frost commonly takes us by the Nose."</blockquote>
            <li>Round about our Coal Fire: or Christmas Entertainments, 1732</li>
		</div>
		
		<p>Born as a spirit to justify the pinch in ones cheek in the winter, Jack Frost has been in Anglo-Saxon folk lore since at least 1732 although likely for much longer.
		</p>
		<p>Jack Frost's origins described him as a man, completely different than the adorable spire you see above. It wasn't until the late 19th centure that a sprite like shape
		began to form around him and patterns in frozen windows gained meaning.</p>

		<p>He has appeared in many a media, often in stories revoling around Christmas, as a trickster in the winter. Sometimes associated with fall leaves, often a reason for all 
		negative factors of winter.</p>
		<Image src = {MT2JackFrost} alt = 'Jack Frosts SMT5 model' width=250 height=250 class = "smt5jf"/>

		
		
	</div>
	<br/>
	<div class = 'container'>
	    <div class ='quote'>
					<blockquote>"I don't give a hee-ho!"</blockquote>
	    </div>
		<p>Jack frost has had many a from in SMT. Starting off as a humble snowman in Megami Tensei 2 before his iconic design got added in SMT1.</p>
		<p> I'll briefly list the ones I like in a list here, but bear with me there is a lot of (justified) Jack Frost forms!</p>
		<div class = 'gallery'>
            <FrostDetails imagePath="/src/assets/jackFrost/JackoLantern.png", altText="Jack-o-Lantern", name = "JackLantern", titleColor = "red">
		    Finding his origins in Megami Tensei 2 as well, this Frost is probably the least frost of them all, instead finding his origins
            </FrostDetails>
            <FrostDetails imagePath="/src/assets/jackFrost/nahobeeho.png", altText="Nahobeeho!", name = "Nahobeeho", titleColor = "red">
		    Finding his origins in Megami Tensei 2 as well, this Frost is probably the least frost of them all, instead finding his origins
            </FrostDetails>
		</div>
		
		
	</div>

	<br/>
	<div class = 'container'>
	    <h2>Why I think he is swell</h2>
		<figure>
		    <Image src ={Heehoing} alt = 'The hee-hoing fairy godmother' class = "demoneeho"/> 
			<figcaption>Demonee-ho quoting Gunnery Sergeant Hartman from Full Metal Jacket</figcaption>
		</figure>
					
		<p> Jack Frost got to me almost instantly recently when I played SMT5 for the first time. I got a glimpse of Nahobeeho at some point, and seeing the earnestness of the costume
		got to me. Jack Frost is not a weak soul. His conviction to being a little shit is so admirable. The art of him I see online. His beautiful smile. And the stupid hee-ho puns that
		his dialogue consists of gets me evheery time, ho! Hee-ho is this adorable phrase that gets funnier the more unhinged the Frosts dialogue. One of my personal favourite's comes from
		SMT4's challege quests with Demonee-ho leading, in which the fairy says Replacing 'fuck' with 
		'hee-ho' might be the funniest thing anyones ever done.</p>
		
	</div>
	
	<br/>
	<div class = 'container'>
	    <h2>Some cool Jack Frost Gifs!!</h2>
        <div class = 'gallery'>
    	    <Image src = {RaihoGif} alt ='Raiho spinning' class = 'galleryImg'/>
    		<Image src = {JFTrue} alt = 'Jack Frost with the word true over him' class = 'galleryImg'/>
    		<Image src = {NahoUlt} alt = 'Nahobeeho unique ability' class = 'galleryImg'/>
    	</div>
	</div>

	
	</body>
</html>
<style>
body{
    background-image: url(../assets/jackFrost/jfBackground.png);
    background-size: repeat;
}

div.container {

	border-radius: 5px;
	border: solid;
	border-color:rgba(82, 80, 85);
	border-width: 2px;
	margin:auto;
	margin-top: 0;
	padding: 1%;
	width: 70%;
    color:#cbced5;
	justify-content: center;
	background-color:rgba(25, 29, 188);
	cursor: url('../assets/jackFrost/cursor.cur'), default;

}

div.gallery{

    display:flex;
    gap: 1em;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

figure {
  border: thin silver solid;
  display: flex;
  flex-flow: column;
  padding: 5px;
  width: 14em;
  margin: auto;
  float:left;
  margin-right: 1em;
}

figcaption {
  background-color: #222222;
  color: white;
  text-wrap: wrap;
  font-size: 0.8em;
}

.smt5jf{
    float:right;
    position:relative;
    
}

.galleryImg{
    width:15em;
    height: 250px;
    border: thick double whitesmoke;
}

header{
    margin:auto;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    height: 6.5em;
}

h1{
    /*padding: 150px 20px;*/
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow:
            -2px -2px 0 #000,
            2px -2px 0 #000,
            -2px 2px 0 #000,
            2px 2px 0 #000,
            -3px 0px 0 #000,
            3px 0px 0 #000,
            0px -3px 0 #000,
            0px 3px 0 #000;
}

div.quote{
    background: darkslateblue;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: thick double black;
    min-width: 15em;
}

div.quote li{
    list-style-type:square;
    margin-left:auto;
    font-size: 0.8em;
}

.demoneeho
{
    width:14em;
    height: 150px;
    
}
</style>
